msgid ""
"Keep the cart always updated in the background, no full page reloads when "
"quantities change."
msgstr ""
"Weka kikapu kikisasishwa kila wakati chinichini, hakuna upakiaji upya wa "
"ukurasa mzima wakati idadi inabadilika."

