msgstr ""
"Weka misimbo ya kuponi, usafirishaji, na mauzo mtambuka mahali ambapo "
"yanabadilisha bidhaa vizuri zaidi."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-cart.php:292
msgid ""
"Keep the order summary visible while scrolling, and add trust symbols where "
"shoppers need reassurance."
msgstr ""
"Weka muhtasari wa agizo ukionekana unaposogeza, na ongeza alama za uaminifu "
"ambapo wanunuzi wanahitaji uhakikisho."

