"Mitindo ya jumla ya hatua za kulipa, muhtasari wa agizo na sehemu zingine. "
"Inatumika kwa malipo mengine, kikapu, asante (agizo limepokelewa), na "
"tazama kurasa za agizo."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:121
msgid ""
"When using the <em>\"1 column\"</em> layout with the <em>\"Split\"</em> "
