"Pembeni wa Malipo, Upau wa Pembeni wa Kikapu, au Upau wa Pembeni wa Agizo "
"Uliopokelewa). Vinginevyo ukurasa unabaki kama safu wima moja yenye mitindo "
"ya Gawanya."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:138
msgid "Split column background"
msgstr "Gawanya mandharinyuma ya safu wima"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:140
msgid ""
"Choose a background color for the Split design secondary column. Leave "
