#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:301
msgid ""
"Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the "
"current user's data, or pass user_id to target another account when the "
"caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests "
"return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found."
msgstr ""
"Maombi yanahitaji mtumiaji wa WordPress aliyeingia. Acha kitambulisho cha "
"mtumiaji ili kutumia data ya mtumiaji wa sasa, au toa kitambulisho cha "
"mtumiaji ili kulenga akaunti nyingine wakati mpigaji anaweza kuhariri "
"mtumiaji huyo (uwezo wa kuhariri_mtumiaji). Maombi ambayo hayajathibitishwa "
"hurejesha fc_api_forbidden. Kitambulisho cha mtumiaji batili hurejesha "
"fc_api_user_not_found."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:316
msgid "HTTP 200 with { \"data\": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 200 yenye { &quot;data&quot;: { ... } } wakati kidhibiti kinarudisha "
"mzigo wa malipo."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:317
msgid ""
"HTTP 200 with { \"success\": true } when there is no payload (for example "
"DELETE)."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 200 yenye { &quot;success&quot;: true } wakati hakuna mzigo wa malipo "
"(kwa mfano DELETE)."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:318
msgid ""
"Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, "
"data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix."
msgstr ""
"Kushindwa hurejesha hitilafu ya WordPress REST JSON kutoka WP_Error "
"(msimbo, ujumbe, data.status). Misimbo ya waya hutumia kiambishi awali cha "
"fc_api_*."

